        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Disposal, van &lt; 3.5t</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Disposal, van &lt; 3.5t
For the disposal of steel, aluminium and cooper and tyres a cut off allocation is applied. ;
UUID: 2bba2abd-74a1-4434-baca-49590c63f7d0
The inventory includes disposal processes for bulk materials. For the disposal of tyres a cut off allocation is applied. However, the transportation of tyres to the cement works is taken into account
Location: Data represent Swiss conditions
Technology: no technologies are specified
Time period: Data represents conditions of the 1990ties
Production volume: na
Sampling: data is based on the material consumption of vehicles. For the transportation of used tyres an expert estimate is used. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2bba2abd-74a1-4434-baca-49590c63f7d0.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
